{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twinspell is a cooperative roguelike dungeon crawler where players control two characters on an epic journey through alternate dimensions. Together, they must explore procedurally generated dungeons and face powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With fast-paced, strategic action gameplay, players must balance exploration, combat, and collecting passive relics to strengthen their abilities. Each victory grants experience and new progression options, while each defeat is a chance to learn from mistakes and try again in a completely new dungeon. Prepare for unique challenges each time you play, where cooperation between characters is the key to survival.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547800?t=1743192952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547800/4f4217986f8f99e7f32a8e83bb657b1ed11d67b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743192952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547800/6e30600794a7a78d76db9017f983804778fddc89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743192952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547800/6e30600794a7a78d76db9017f983804778fddc89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743192952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph